  "notes": "EL15XP1 and EL16XP1 Unit Information text pages also describe an A108 demand defrost board with P4 coil/ambient sensors, but their wiring diagrams show this CMC1 + S6 defrost thermostat. Look at the board: DF terminals with a defrost thermostat = this map; a 6-pin sensor plug with coil + ambient sensors = A108 (use the lennox-xp14-a108-outdoor pinout). 13HPX diagram note: LO-PS and HI-PS must be jumpered when that optional switch is not used.",
