  "test": "LEDs first. Sensor fault: unplug P4, ohm RT21 (5-6) and RT13 (3-4) on the harness - open or shorted = replace the harness. Pins 1-2 should read about 10K ohms (resistor).",
  "notes": "Pins from the wiring diagrams (RT21 on 6-5, RT13 on 4-3, DISCH resistor on 2-1) and Table 3 (coil P4-5/6, ambient P4-3/4). These R-454B service manuals print no resistance chart; the RT13/RT21 chart in the XP14 manual (lennox-rt13-rt21-xp14) is for the R-410A boards and is not confirmed for KP1.",
