  "test": "Status: amber LED, 2-digit code = short flashes then long flashes. Continuous off = check 115 V at L1/L2 and 24 V at SEC-1/SEC-2; continuous on = 24 V present, no fault; rapid flash = 115 V polarity reversed. Code recall: R lead off, reset power, SW1-1 ON. Component test: R lead off, reset power, SW1-6 ON - inducer high for the whole test, igniter 15 s, blower 15 s, inducer low 10 s; 11 = no errors, 25 = setup error.",
  "notes": "Same board and plug numbering in 58TP0A-01SI (diagram A190046), -02SI (A190269) and -03SI (A210177). Codes: 11 no previous code, 12 blower on after power up, 13 limit lockout, 14 ignition lockout, 21 gas heating lockout, 22 abnormal flame signal, 23 pressure switch did not open, 24 24 V fuse open, 25 model/setup error, 31 HPS/relay did not close, 32 LPS did not close or reopened, 33 limit circuit fault, 34 ignition proving failure, 43 LPS open while HPS closed, 45 control circuitry lockout.",
  "gaps": [
   "Limit open/close temperature not in manual",
   "Pressure switch set points not in manual",
   "Igniter ohms not in manual",
   "PL9 OAT connector only in legend - use and sensor chart not given"
  ],
